    rationale: { body: "After any med error, the priority is the client: assess for adverse effects, notify the provider, monitor as ordered, and document the event in the medical record (objectively, factually). File an incident report per institutional policy; the report is for quality improvement and is not part of the medical record.", sources: [NCSBN_RN_PLAN, { label: "ISMP — Medication Error Reporting Best Practices" }] },
