    rationale: { body: "Fluoroquinolones (cipro, levo, moxi) carry FDA black-box warnings for tendinitis and tendon rupture (especially Achilles), peripheral neuropathy, and CNS effects. New tendon pain or swelling = STOP and notify. Avoid taking with antacids, calcium, iron, or dairy (chelation reduces absorption).", sources: [NCSBN_RN_PLAN, { label: "FDA Black-Box Warning — Fluoroquinolones" }] },
